# Page Modal Components

- If a page renders a modal, move the entire modal overlay and dialog markup into a separate colocated component.
- Treat the whole block inside conditions like `{modalMode && (` or `{scopeToDelete && (` as modal UI that belongs in its own component.
- Keep page files focused on page layout, state wiring, and event handlers.
- The page may keep the modal state and pass props down, but should not inline the dialog structure itself.
